{"unit_id":"FIZMIE__dsh-net-proxy#card-zh","repo":"FIZMIE/dsh-net-proxy","commit":"728fb0b868ce26dd29697860972a6aeb370487c5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-net-proxy 是面向 DeepSeek Harness desktop 的网络代理插件：它在 DSH 设置页提供订阅导入、代理开关、节点状态和活动日志。启用后，插件启动随包提供的 mihomo 内核，读取 Clash YAML 订阅并测量节点延迟，自动选用可用的较快节点；节点失败时会冷却并尝试切换。用户也可手动固定节点或恢复自动选择。适合需要让 DSH 出网请求经订阅代理访问网络的场景；需要 Windows x64 环境和用户已有的 Clash 格式订阅。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:173-195","client/client.js:250-289","lib/index.js:918-968","lib/index.js:100-121"]}
{"unit_id":"FIZMIE__dsh-net-proxy#card-en","repo":"FIZMIE/dsh-net-proxy","commit":"728fb0b868ce26dd29697860972a6aeb370487c5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-net-proxy adds a proxy settings page to DeepSeek Harness desktop. It imports a Clash YAML subscription, starts bundled mihomo, measures nodes, selects a fast node, and switches after failures. Users can pin a node or use automatic selection. Requires Windows x64 and a subscription.","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:173-195","client/client.js:250-289","lib/index.js:918-968","lib/index.js:100-121"]}
