{"unit_id":"FIZMIE__dsh-net-proxy#feature-subscription","repo":"FIZMIE/dsh-net-proxy","commit":"728fb0b868ce26dd29697860972a6aeb370487c5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-net-proxy 的功能「订阅导入」：用户在网络代理设置页粘贴 Clash 订阅链接并更新，插件将链接保存并重新导入配置，供内置 mihomo 内核使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:290-335","lib/index.js:1392-1400"]}
